From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] virtio_balloon: maximum batches for dense microVM hosts

Stock (and 0001) batching still needs many inflate/deflate round-trips
for large adjustments: with 1024 pfns per batch (4 MiB on 4K pages) a
512 MiB inflate needs 128 tell_host() round-trips, each a synchronous
virtqueue wait.

Push to the practical maximum for hosts that balloon many microVMs at
once:

- 1024 -> 8192 pfns per batch (32 MiB per round-trip on 4K pages, 16x
  fewer round-trips than stock; the pfn array grows from 4 KiB to
  32 KiB - still negligible vs the reclaimed memory, and still a single
  cheap kzalloc at probe time. Larger (16384+) risks probe-time
  high-order allocation failure, which would kill the balloon entirely).
- OOM deflate 1024 -> 32768 pages (up to 128 MiB freed per OOM event
  once 0009's drain loop is applied; each tell_host() batch is still
  capped at 8192 pfns, so this is 4 looped batches. Without the loop a
  single leak_balloon() call clamps to the array size, i.e. 32 MiB -
  still 2x the previous 16 MiB).

No behaviour change when the host does not balloon. All virtio feature
bits are untouched.

Tunable: edit the two defines below to taste.

Signed-off-by: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
---
 drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
index 123456789013..123456789022 100644
--- a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
+++ b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@
  * page units.
  */
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_PAGES_PER_PAGE (unsigned int)(PAGE_SIZE >> VIRTIO_BALLOON_PFN_SHIFT)
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 1024
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 8192
 /* Maximum number of (4k) pages to deflate on OOM notifications. */
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NR_PAGES 1024
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NR_PAGES 32768
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NOTIFY_PRIORITY 80
--
2.47.0
